      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know what you're gonna say about 'new beginnings' and 'cycles' but it doesn't change the math. i've put two decades of energy into something that's now zero. i'm basically a bankrupt person, not just financially, but existentially. it's like i spent all my chips on a game that was rigged. i'm just so tired of trying to find a reason to keep playing a game that's already been lost. it doesn't even feel like a setback anymore, it just feels like the end of the line.",
